"""Publishing-and-periodicals word detector for layers.0.mlp.down_proj:5301.

This component reads the current token only (layer 0 output is nearly a pure
function of the token). It fires on words about publishing and the print media:
strongest on the "publish" family (publish, published, publisher, publishing),
moderate on "publication", "journal", "magazine", and weak on other media words
